1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 2=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:50,840
Keep a close eye on her these days.

7
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,319
I'm afraid

8
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:57,120
Young Lady can't
get over it anytime soon.

9
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,680
I'm just afraid

10
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,920
she can endure what's before her,

11
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,239
but not what's to come.

12
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,400
What if

13
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:10,800
someone gets suspicious?

14
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,319
Don't worry about that.

15
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,479
Our Lanxiang

16
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:18,680
has lived in the capital
since childhood.

17
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:21,680
She's also been sick at home
for many years.

18
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,520
Let alone Jinling,

19
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:25,120
even in the capital,

20
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:27,319
hardly anyone truly knows

21
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:29,280
what Lanxiang really looks like.

22
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:33,120
If she ever

23
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:35,879
meets some acquaintance,

24
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:40,000
just say she's grown and changed.

25
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,439
Anyway, from today onward,

26
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:46,919
she is Lanxiang.

27
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,639
After we return to Jinling,

28
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,240
we'll just have to endure more hardship.

29
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:57,479
We mustn't let her suffer.

30
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,479
It's just that I'm sorry

31
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,680
our Lanxiang

32
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:05,879
can't be laid to rest.

33
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:42,120
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

34
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:44,879
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

35
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:54,599
Chrysanthemum greens!

36
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:57,039
(Jinling City)
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

37
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:59,719
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

38
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:02,280
(Taiping)
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

39
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,960
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

40
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,759
Want some chrysanthemum greens?

41
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,599
Chrysanthemum greens!

42
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:10,199
Our secret-recipe duck!

43
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,960
Fresh plum cakes!

44
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,360
Freshly cooked pork-skin noodles!

45
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,360
Chrysanthemum greens!

46
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:17,639
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

47
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,800
Chrysanthemum greens for sale!

48
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:21,560
Chrysanthemum greens!

49
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,040
Fresh chrysanthemum greens!

50
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,079
Slow down.

51
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,920
How about I make you

52
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,648
something tasty?

53
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,040
You little rascal!

54
00:04:34,072 --> 00:04:34,930
- Watch out!
- Stop!

55
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,480
Stop!

56
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,680
Can't you two slow down?

57
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,879
I just hung up those clothes.

58
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:43,700
(Young Lv Ji'er)

59
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:46,079
(Hu Sui'er)
Boys are mischievous.

60
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:47,680
(Liu Wujiu's Wife)
He never behaved.

61
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:49,959
Wujiu.

62
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,000
Look, you're sweating all over.

63
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,959
(Liu Wujiu)

64
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,439
Ji'er, come serve the dishes.

65
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,160
Coming.

66
00:04:59,848 --> 00:05:01,480
(Wang Jinpan)
Careful. Don't spill it.

67
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,740
(Lv Ji'er's Mother)

68
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,639
Grandpa, time to eat.

69
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:12,260
(Mr. Lv, Lv Ji'er's Grandfather)

70
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,560
Hurry.

71
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:23,680
Little bro, run.

72
00:05:24,024 --> 00:05:25,480
Careful, don't bump into anyone.

73
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,639
This oilcloth...

74
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:41,950
Where'd you get it?

75
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,639
The shop didn't want it.

76
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:46,519
The tiles on our roof are broken.

77
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,560
Whenever it rains,

78
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:49,519
the rain drips onto the bed.

79
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:52,319
I begged the head shopkeeper
for this piece of oilcloth.

80
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:54,079
It'll be perfect for the roof.

81
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,240
That's much better.

82
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:01,736
Now we don't have to worry
about Lanxiang getting rained on.

83
00:06:03,192 --> 00:06:04,120
Put it here for now.

84
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:07,360
You two really dote on your daughter.

85
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,439
We can't help it.

86
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:09,720
She's our only daughter.

87
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,319
Is she still not fully recovered?

88
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,759
You've moved here for so long,

89
00:06:16,879 --> 00:06:18,240
yet I've never seen her go out.

90
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,360
I hit it!

91
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:47,480
I finally hit it!

92
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,639
Amazing!

93
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:50,600
I hit it!

94
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,576
I finally hit it!

95
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:54,680
Stop fooling around. Go on.

96
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,460
Go play over there.

97
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:57,560
Thanks for asking, Liu.

98
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,279
My daughter's condition has improved.

99
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:01,839
She still needs to rest.

100
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:04,279
Once she's fully recovered,
she'll naturally come out.

101
00:07:04,328 --> 00:07:05,608
Get back to what you were doing.

102
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,720
How shameless.

103
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:09,480
Serves him right.

104
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,240
Didn't he see?

105
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:12,920
They're from the capital.

106
00:07:12,984 --> 00:07:14,744
Like they'd ever give us
the time of day.

107
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:21,040
Madam...

108
00:07:21,079 --> 00:07:21,800
Forget it.

109
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,879
Forget it.

110
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,480
Why are you pulling me?

111
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:27,639
Better to avoid trouble.

112
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,279
Forget it.

113
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:35,680
Forget it.

114
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:37,079
Get back to work.

115
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,839
Come give me a hand.

116
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,160
You must be hungry.

117
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,720
Hurry and eat.

118
00:08:06,344 --> 00:08:08,072
The younger should respect the elder.

119
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:09,560
You two, please eat first.

120
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,600
Here, sit.

121
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,839
Sit.

122
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,160
Here.

123
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:23,839
Eat.

124
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,680
Eat. We'll eat, too.

125
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:55,759
Your father

126
00:08:56,279 --> 00:08:58,200
hasn't been paid this month.

127
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:00,639
Let's eat this for now.

128
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,679
Once he gets paid,

129
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:05,480
I'll go to Butcher Zhang's

130
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,960
and buy 100 grams of pork.

131
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:09,279
You're too kind.

132
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,120
Don't spend money on me.

133
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,440
I can eat this.

134
00:09:36,279 --> 00:09:37,240
I'll eat outside.

135
00:09:37,799 --> 00:09:38,879
It's a little hot inside.

136
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:57,840
Come.

137
00:09:57,919 --> 00:09:59,720
Good food is being handed out!

138
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,039
Everyone, gather around.

139
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:02,000
Gather around.

140
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,559
There's a happy occasion today.

141
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,039
Come.

142
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:06,759
Come quickly.

143
00:10:06,919 --> 00:10:09,120
Young Master is getting married today.

144
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:10,759
Our First Madam has ordered

145
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:13,120
that each household gets wedding cakes.

146
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,120
Everyone can share in the joy.

147
00:10:17,144 --> 00:10:18,550
Why are you still standing there?

148
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:20,000
One each. Don't grab.

149
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,840
Don't rush. Everyone will get one.

150
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,799
Three over here.

151
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,960
There are more of us.

152
00:10:24,776 --> 00:10:25,670
There are more of us.

153
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,200
Why are you pushing?

154
00:10:31,279 --> 00:10:32,000
Three people.

155
00:10:34,888 --> 00:10:36,440
Young Master is getting married today.

156
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,120
Wedding cakes are given per person.

157
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,120
We got three.

158
00:10:39,879 --> 00:10:40,200
Here.

159
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,519
I don't like these sticky things.

160
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,159
I'm used to eating steamed buns.

161
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:45,960
I'll put these two away.

162
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,960
Eat another one tomorrow at noon,

163
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,320
and one at night.

164
00:10:53,639 --> 00:10:55,799
(Lin)
This is Young Lady's betrothal document.

165
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,240
(Lin)
And this other one...

166
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,960
Is the Lin family

167
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,160
trying to break off the engagement?

168
00:11:03,170 --> 00:11:04,230
(Letter of Broken Engagement)

169
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:04,919
Father.

170
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,799
Could Young Master
get married every day?

171
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,296
(Lin)

172
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:10,679
Then we'd have wedding cakes every day.

173
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:13,440
I want that, too.

174
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,519
Eat. Come on.

175
00:11:16,552 --> 00:11:18,020
Look at the "Double Happiness" character.

176
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:19,559
These wedding cakes are delicious.

177
00:11:38,136 --> 00:11:39,150
Don't you want to eat?

178
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:41,279
Lanxiang.

179
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:42,919
What's wrong?

180
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:56,580
♪The golden sunset sketches my thoughts♪

181
00:11:58,660 --> 00:12:04,580
♪All things fall silent,
fearing to disturb this moment♪

182
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:11,980
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

183
00:12:12,700 --> 00:12:17,159
♪I wonder
if the past has ever been heard♪

184
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:19,879
The bride, Young Lady Zhao,
is quite something.

185
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,080
Her grandfather

186
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,840
is a favorite of His Majesty.

187
00:12:23,976 --> 00:12:25,112
He's a First-Rank official.

188
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,000
Do you know
what a First-Rank official is?

189
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,600
A really, really high-ranking official.

190
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:34,740
♪Half a lifetime of longing
returns to this moment♪

191
00:12:37,399 --> 00:12:39,639
Peace for every generation.

192
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:48,420
♪I still remember your name♪

193
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:57,559
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

194
00:12:57,559 --> 00:12:58,679
What's wrong, child?

195
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,480
You have to eat.

196
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,720
Starving yourself will only hurt you.

197
00:13:06,799 --> 00:13:07,600
Be a good girl.

198
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:09,519
Here, eat.

199
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:13,720
Is...

200
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,159
Is this Lin family...

201
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:18,080
the one...

202
00:13:19,519 --> 00:13:20,480
I can't read.

203
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:22,320
This...

204
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,600
This... This is the character "Lin".

205
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,799
Is it

206
00:13:32,559 --> 00:13:34,639
the Lin family I was betrothed to?

207
00:13:44,519 --> 00:13:46,279
They don't even know their place.

208
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,200
Everyone in our compound,

209
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,840
young and old,

210
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:52,120
is born a servant of the Lin family.

211
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,840
Servants born to servants.

212
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:56,759
(Lin)

213
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:58,320
Look. It's so beautiful.

214
00:13:58,519 --> 00:13:59,240
So pretty.

215
00:14:25,159 --> 00:14:25,759
Cry.

216
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:30,919
If you want to cry, cry your heart out.

217
00:14:36,380 --> 00:14:37,360
Cry as hard as you can.

218
00:14:40,559 --> 00:14:41,600
Cry it all out.

219
00:14:43,159 --> 00:14:45,039
Then we'll live well afterward.

220
00:14:48,056 --> 00:14:49,150
Live with all your might.

221
00:14:51,879 --> 00:14:52,600
Live fiercely.

222
00:14:56,679 --> 00:14:57,799
Just like wild grass.

223
00:14:59,679 --> 00:15:01,200
Live shamelessly and freely.

224
00:15:02,919 --> 00:15:04,440
From now on,

225
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,440
there'll only be spring

226
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:11,600
and no winter.

227
00:15:19,039 --> 00:15:21,120
We'll live without a care.

228
00:15:53,279 --> 00:15:53,600
Here.

229
00:15:54,039 --> 00:15:54,840
Here, give it to me.

230
00:15:59,559 --> 00:16:00,200
Enough?

231
00:16:00,759 --> 00:16:01,320
That's enough.

232
00:16:01,519 --> 00:16:01,879
Enough.

233
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,360
Just a little is enough.

234
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:07,720
Keep your hand low,

235
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,919
and the oil won't splatter on you.

236
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,080
How is it?

237
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:15,960
Feeling better today?

238
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,080
No, I can't take your family's things.

239
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,200
Why are you so polite?

240
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:45,159
Take it.

241
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,840
Keep it and eat it slowly.

242
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:49,399
If it's good, tell me later.

243
00:16:49,519 --> 00:16:50,600
Keep it for yourselves.

244
00:16:51,279 --> 00:16:52,080
Take it.

245
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:52,759
No.

246
00:16:52,759 --> 00:16:54,360
I can't take your things.

247
00:17:15,279 --> 00:17:15,799
Father.

248
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:16,880
The paste.

249
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,480
I've already put it up.

250
00:17:18,696 --> 00:17:19,350
How does it look?

251
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,279
It's upside down.

252
00:17:21,752 --> 00:17:22,824
This is how it should be.

253
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,880
Alright.

254
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:36,519
Let's go. Come inside.

255
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:43,519
Lanxiang.

256
00:17:44,079 --> 00:17:44,599
Come.

257
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:45,839
I've got good stuff.

258
00:17:56,039 --> 00:17:56,839
Write one.

259
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:21,740
(Six Years Later)

260
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:31,380
(Xu)

261
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:34,220
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

262
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:35,300
(Xu Lanxiang)

263
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:38,460
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

264
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:42,980
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

265
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:44,440
Father.

266
00:18:45,039 --> 00:18:46,079
Write this character.

267
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,559
This is...

268
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:48,799
"Xu".

269
00:18:49,319 --> 00:18:50,640
This is how you write "Xu"?

270
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:51,920
Alright.

271
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:52,880
Let me see.

272
00:18:53,039 --> 00:18:54,880
Start with a dot.

273
00:18:59,559 --> 00:19:01,680
Then draw a long horizontal stroke.

274
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:04,519
Then two below.

275
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:09,540
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

276
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:13,620
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

277
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:18,940
♪Four seasons wax and wane,
year after year♪

278
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:21,980
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

279
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:26,300
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

280
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:27,960
Lanxiang.

281
00:19:29,839 --> 00:19:30,640
Mother.

282
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:31,559
Come help me

283
00:19:31,839 --> 00:19:33,119
hang up the clothes.

284
00:19:42,599 --> 00:19:44,680
(Lv Family's Eldest and Youngest Sons)
Hit her.

285
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,660
(Lv Ji'er)

286
00:20:00,759 --> 00:20:02,200
You little rascal!

287
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,400
Give back the slingshot.

288
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:05,880
Stop!

289
00:21:02,279 --> 00:21:03,000
You brat!

290
00:21:03,416 --> 00:21:05,030
You can't even do this simple task.

291
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:06,920
What's the use of raising you?

292
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,359
Look.

293
00:21:07,559 --> 00:21:08,039
Careful.

294
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:09,400
Are you alright?

295
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,480
Hurry and hang them up.

296
00:21:18,839 --> 00:21:19,640
Lanxiang.

297
00:21:20,319 --> 00:21:20,839
Father.

298
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:21,440
We're here.

299
00:21:32,839 --> 00:21:33,359
What's wrong?

300
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:55,839
All these years,

301
00:21:56,119 --> 00:21:57,599
I've been asking around

302
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,359
where the Shen family was buried.

303
00:21:59,759 --> 00:22:01,359
But there was never any news.

304
00:22:02,039 --> 00:22:04,039
Today, a merchant from the capital

305
00:22:04,079 --> 00:22:05,759
came to the shop.

306
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:07,880
He happened to mention

307
00:22:08,599 --> 00:22:10,079
that six years ago,

308
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:11,559
someone

309
00:22:13,559 --> 00:22:16,559
collected the remains
of Grand Secretary Shen's family.

310
00:22:20,079 --> 00:22:20,759
Really?

311
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:22,359
Absolutely.

312
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:26,359
But he doesn't know

313
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:27,240
who this kind soul is

314
00:22:27,304 --> 00:22:28,920
or where the Shen family was buried.

315
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:36,359
May the Bodhisattva bless us.

316
00:22:36,359 --> 00:22:38,279
Amitabha.

317
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,119
The stone in my heart

318
00:22:40,359 --> 00:22:41,519
has finally been lifted.

319
00:22:46,359 --> 00:22:47,000
Lanxiang.

320
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,279
Go on.

321
00:22:49,192 --> 00:22:50,390
Light incense for your parents

322
00:22:50,559 --> 00:22:53,680
and your other family members.

323
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:54,839
Amitabha.

324
00:22:55,416 --> 00:22:56,550
At least they're no longer

325
00:22:56,559 --> 00:22:58,799
restless spirits with nowhere to go.

326
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:40,319
Father.

327
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:42,559
Mother.

328
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,440
Don't worry.

329
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:50,799
The Xu family treats me very well.

330
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,119
In this life,

331
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,799
I'll be sure to treat them well

332
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:58,759
and care for them until old age.

333
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:01,519
In my next life,

334
00:24:04,559 --> 00:24:06,039
I'll be your daughter again.

335
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:19,200
Heaven above,

336
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:21,039
and Earth below, bear witness.

337
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:24,759
Today, honorable men
have recovered the remains

338
00:24:25,039 --> 00:24:27,160
of the Shen family and Lanxiang

339
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,640
and laid them all to rest.

340
00:24:30,568 --> 00:24:32,136
I owe them a debt beyond measure.

341
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:34,799
I'll never forget what they've done,

342
00:24:35,519 --> 00:24:37,200
and I swear I'll repay them one day.

343
00:26:16,119 --> 00:26:17,839
(Lin Jinqi)
The rebel leader is dead.

344
00:26:18,660 --> 00:26:21,420
(Jinzhou Seaside Fishing Village)

345
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:25,119
Those who resist...

346
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,960
are to be killed without mercy.

347
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:41,680
- Good!
- Good!

348
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:44,780
- Good!
- Good!

349
00:26:44,780 --> 00:26:46,160
(Nanke, Lin Jinqi's Attendant)
Good!

350
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,220
- Good!
- Good!

351
00:26:47,220 --> 00:26:49,176
(Jiugao, Lin Jinqi's Attendant)
Good!

352
00:26:49,208 --> 00:26:50,312
(Du Zheng, Courtesy Name Congyi, Junior)
- Good!

353
00:26:50,312 --> 00:26:51,500
(Banner Officer of the Jinzhou Guards)
Good!

354
00:26:51,500 --> 00:26:57,839
- Good!
- Good!

355
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:08,960
Fresh chrysanthemum greens.

356
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,039
Chrysanthemum greens.

357
00:27:13,140 --> 00:27:16,440
(Rongbao Pavilion)

358
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,240
Look at Xu.

359
00:27:17,319 --> 00:27:18,359
Look at this mess.

360
00:27:18,519 --> 00:27:19,599
He finally minded the shop,

361
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:21,359
yet he was so unlucky.

362
00:27:21,359 --> 00:27:22,599
He lost everything this time.

363
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,160
You're here.

364
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,279
Master Craftsman.

365
00:27:29,279 --> 00:27:30,740
(Rongbao Pavilion's Master Craftsman)

366
00:27:32,799 --> 00:27:33,400
Lanxiang.

367
00:27:33,512 --> 00:27:34,968
Bringing your father his lunch again?

368
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,470
I'm going to the back to find him.

369
00:27:36,759 --> 00:27:37,480
Head Shopkeeper.

370
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:38,359
Head Shopkeeper.

371
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:39,839
Please take another look.

372
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,240
Just one more look.

373
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:41,960
Move aside.

374
00:27:42,559 --> 00:27:43,319
Get out of the way.

375
00:27:43,320 --> 00:27:45,064
Please take another look
at this painting.

376
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,960
It really is a fine painting.

377
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:48,160
Just take one more look.

378
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:50,079
I told you to mind the shop.

379
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:51,464
(Huang Youzhi)
Just mind it.

380
00:27:51,470 --> 00:27:53,580
(Rongbao Pavilion's Head Shopkeeper)
Look what happened.

381
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:55,359
You took in a fake painting.

382
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,480
I'm only making you pay five taels.

383
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:59,359
That's already very merciful.

384
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:00,960
Just look at it again.

385
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,680
Get out of my way.

386
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:03,359
Father.

387
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,240
Useless fool.

388
00:28:05,279 --> 00:28:05,839
Lanxiang.

389
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,119
This...

390
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,640
How could this painting be fake?

391
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:30,880
Five taels of silver?

392
00:28:31,559 --> 00:28:32,319
Five taels?

393
00:28:33,079 --> 00:28:33,839
How many nights

394
00:28:33,839 --> 00:28:35,119
will Lanxiang and I have to work

395
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:36,559
to earn that much again?

396
00:28:37,559 --> 00:28:39,559
How could it be fake?

397
00:28:40,559 --> 00:28:41,599
That painting

398
00:28:41,839 --> 00:28:43,160
and the poem on it

399
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:45,400
have this indescribable

400
00:28:46,079 --> 00:28:47,720
artistic charm.

401
00:28:47,759 --> 00:28:49,240
What artistic charm?

402
00:28:50,079 --> 00:28:51,079
You only learned

403
00:28:51,119 --> 00:28:52,440
a few characters from Lanxiang.

404
00:28:53,519 --> 00:28:55,400
You really think you're a scholar?

405
00:28:57,839 --> 00:28:58,839
I won't learn anymore.

406
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:00,839
I'll never learn again!

407
00:29:01,160 --> 00:29:02,319
Never again!

408
00:29:02,519 --> 00:29:03,920
What's the use of learning?

409
00:29:04,759 --> 00:29:06,559
Learning to read only brought trouble.

410
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:09,119
A good-for-nothing will always be one!

411
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,640
Learning won't change that.

412
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:28,920
I just thought...

413
00:29:32,720 --> 00:29:34,279
If that painting is real,

414
00:29:34,359 --> 00:29:35,160
and we sell it,

415
00:29:35,680 --> 00:29:38,160
I could get a silver tael as a reward.

416
00:29:45,319 --> 00:29:47,160
Lanxiang isn't young anymore.

417
00:29:49,440 --> 00:29:51,440
We need to save some money

418
00:29:52,039 --> 00:29:53,039
to buy her freedom.

419
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,519
What else can we do?

420
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:57,960
Are we going to let her be like us,

421
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:01,839
two slaves
giving birth to another slave?

422
00:30:02,359 --> 00:30:04,079
Be slaves for generations to come?

423
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:13,079
Father, Mother.

424
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:21,960
I have an idea.

425
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:24,759
We won't have to pay the five taels,

426
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:25,839
and maybe

427
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:27,519
we can even make some money.

428
00:30:30,799 --> 00:30:31,480
Really?

429
00:30:34,248 --> 00:30:36,700
(Rongbao Pavilion)

430
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:38,960
Old Master.

431
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:42,079
These just came in this month.

432
00:30:48,319 --> 00:30:49,799
This calligraphy is quite good.

433
00:30:53,000 --> 00:30:54,720
Didn't Father say before

434
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:57,279
that Old Master Lin collects landscapes

435
00:30:57,559 --> 00:30:59,720
and visits the shop every ten days?

436
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:02,240
As long as we see Old Master Lin...

437
00:31:02,839 --> 00:31:03,680
Old Master.

438
00:31:04,480 --> 00:31:07,240
What do you think of this calligraphy?

439
00:31:08,839 --> 00:31:09,720
It's good.

440
00:31:10,519 --> 00:31:11,240
Good.

441
00:31:12,079 --> 00:31:15,400
It's a pity we never get
an original by Li Yingqiu.

442
00:31:16,319 --> 00:31:17,960
Quite a few people have heard

443
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:19,759
that you like Li Yingqiu,

444
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:21,880
so they bring fake paintings to sell.

445
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:26,799
Let's look upstairs.

446
00:31:41,519 --> 00:31:43,240
Who hung this painting here?

447
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:44,680
Take it down.

448
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,079
Quickly.

449
00:31:48,519 --> 00:31:49,440
Old Master.

450
00:31:49,839 --> 00:31:51,039
This fake painting

451
00:31:51,279 --> 00:31:53,359
was bought by a shop hand.

452
00:31:54,039 --> 00:31:55,880
That day, I went south of the city

453
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:56,839
to buy antiques.

454
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:58,240
I wasn't at the shop.

455
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,400
Why are you hiding? Come here.

456
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,079
Greetings, Old Master.

457
00:32:05,559 --> 00:32:06,279
Xu.

458
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:08,960
It... It was him.

459
00:32:13,319 --> 00:32:15,119
Old Master will surely ask you

460
00:32:15,480 --> 00:32:16,960
why you took that painting.

461
00:32:17,759 --> 00:32:19,480
The brushwork and ink

462
00:32:19,599 --> 00:32:21,400
are very much like Li Yingqiu's style,

463
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:22,440
but

464
00:32:22,519 --> 00:32:24,960
the inscription
uses the lampblack ink of Hui ink.

465
00:32:25,519 --> 00:32:27,680
Li Yingqiu
lived in the early Northern Song,

466
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,000
but this lampblack ink

467
00:32:29,119 --> 00:32:31,319
hadn't appeared
in the early Northern Song.

468
00:32:31,720 --> 00:32:33,559
It's clearly a fake painting.

469
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:36,240
That's exactly
what the head shopkeeper said.

470
00:32:37,160 --> 00:32:39,640
What if Old Master asks the same thing?

471
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:46,319
Just answer

472
00:32:46,376 --> 00:32:47,512
why you took the painting.

473
00:32:48,060 --> 00:32:50,380
(Drifting Alone on the River)

474
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:52,359
I just thought

475
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:54,920
it had an artistic charm.

476
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,799
Artistic charm?

477
00:32:57,559 --> 00:32:58,279
Yes.

478
00:32:58,359 --> 00:32:59,160
Artistic charm.

479
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:02,079
I can't really explain it.

480
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:05,880
I just thought the painting was good,

481
00:33:06,392 --> 00:33:07,880
and the calligraphy was good, too.

482
00:33:08,039 --> 00:33:09,319
But the best part

483
00:33:10,359 --> 00:33:12,799
is still this poem.

484
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:20,440
Inscribed on the Cold Mountain Painting.

485
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:26,319
You can tell Old Master Lin the truth.

486
00:33:26,360 --> 00:33:27,592
You don't understand poetry.

487
00:33:27,640 --> 00:33:29,680
You only learned
a few words from your daughter.

488
00:33:31,559 --> 00:33:33,319
But you're a hereditary slave.

489
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:35,200
How could you know how to read?

490
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:36,480
Mother.

491
00:33:36,559 --> 00:33:37,440
Don't you remember?

492
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,000
When we were in the capital,

493
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:40,440
I was often ill.

494
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:42,839
The housekeeper feared
catching my illness

495
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,440
and made us move out.

496
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:46,559
The three of us

497
00:33:46,799 --> 00:33:48,799
had no choice but to stay at a nunnery.

498
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:50,440
The nun there

499
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:52,079
was very fond of my daughter.

500
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:55,599
She often took her to chant prayers.

501
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,680
That's how she learned to read.

502
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:00,480
Also,

503
00:34:01,119 --> 00:34:02,960
ever since I came to Jinling

504
00:34:03,279 --> 00:34:04,839
and worked at Rongbao Pavilion,

505
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:07,319
I've often received
the head shopkeeper's guidance.

506
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:09,480
I don't understand much either.

507
00:34:09,639 --> 00:34:12,440
I just think this poem is well written.

508
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:14,840
Xu.

509
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:17,960
I told you not to take it to heart.

510
00:34:18,280 --> 00:34:19,199
Teaching you

511
00:34:19,199 --> 00:34:21,079
was also for the shop's sake.

512
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:28,400
It seems Buddha intended

513
00:34:29,639 --> 00:34:32,480
for Li Yingqiu's Cold Mountain

514
00:34:33,159 --> 00:34:35,039
to see the light of day again.

515
00:34:39,760 --> 00:34:40,639
This painting...

516
00:34:41,760 --> 00:34:42,679
It's fake.

517
00:34:47,239 --> 00:34:48,840
Yet it's also real.

518
00:35:16,599 --> 00:35:19,840
This painting was once owned
by Scholar Yi'an.

519
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:24,079
In her later years,
Scholar Yi'an suffered through war.

520
00:35:24,559 --> 00:35:26,599
Most of her antiques,
calligraphy, and paintings

521
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:29,719
were looted and lost.

522
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:32,519
To protect this painting,

523
00:35:33,079 --> 00:35:35,960
she made an identical copy

524
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:39,679
and left an obvious flaw, lampblack ink,

525
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:41,719
(By Heyang's Li Yingqiu)
in the inscription.

526
00:35:42,719 --> 00:35:45,519
This meant that
even if someone stole it,

527
00:35:45,679 --> 00:35:47,559
they'd think it was a forgery.

528
00:35:48,280 --> 00:35:52,519
They'd never imagine the original
was hidden beneath the fake.

529
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:53,920
That's right.

530
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,760
To find it later,

531
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:58,000
Scholar Yi'an

532
00:35:58,280 --> 00:36:00,679
wrote this poem as a marker.

533
00:36:02,159 --> 00:36:03,559
Who would've thought?

534
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,920
Who would've thought
that two centuries later,

535
00:36:07,679 --> 00:36:10,119
an uneducated servant

536
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:13,039
would become her kindred spirit?

537
00:36:15,760 --> 00:36:18,119
They say fools can be lucky,

538
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:21,960
but Xu is diligent, too.

539
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,159
Our shop currently

540
00:36:24,159 --> 00:36:27,519
needs a third shopkeeper
for calligraphy and paintings.

541
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:30,320
What do you think, Old Master?

542
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:31,320
Well...

543
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,599
You can decide

544
00:36:32,679 --> 00:36:33,480
the shop's affairs.

545
00:36:34,639 --> 00:36:35,199
Alright.

546
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:37,920
Why wait for a better day
when today's perfect?

547
00:36:38,679 --> 00:36:39,760
Starting today,

548
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:42,599
Xu is Rongbao Pavilion's

549
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:44,280
third shopkeeper.

550
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:49,559
Wonderful.

551
00:36:49,639 --> 00:36:50,360
Then...

552
00:36:50,920 --> 00:36:51,920
Congratulations, Xu.

553
00:36:52,119 --> 00:36:52,840
No.

554
00:36:53,159 --> 00:36:54,679
Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

555
00:36:54,728 --> 00:36:56,000
Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

556
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:58,248
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

557
00:36:58,250 --> 00:36:59,688
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.
- Congratulations, Third Shopkeeper.

558
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:02,159
Thank you, Old Master.

559
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:10,639
This is the reward Old Master gave you?

560
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,760
It's ten taels.

561
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,039
Ten taels.

562
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:20,480
Lanxiang.

563
00:37:21,079 --> 00:37:22,559
Did you know all along

564
00:37:22,559 --> 00:37:24,079
that it was a genuine painting?

565
00:37:30,159 --> 00:37:31,119
When I was ten,

566
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:34,119
I heard Grandfather tell this tale.

567
00:37:35,159 --> 00:37:36,440
When I saw that painting,

568
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:38,519
I recognized it.

569
00:37:50,920 --> 00:37:52,280
You have a keen eye.

570
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:54,440
You bought a genuine work right away.

571
00:37:55,039 --> 00:37:56,639
It's mainly thanks to your teaching.

572
00:37:56,920 --> 00:37:59,159
And thanks to your reminder

573
00:37:59,559 --> 00:38:01,920
not to offend the head shopkeeper.

574
00:38:24,119 --> 00:38:25,840
This is the six taels of silver

575
00:38:26,639 --> 00:38:29,400
our family has saved over the years.

576
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:31,000
With this ten taels,

577
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:32,800
we have 16 taels in total.

578
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,639
I've already asked around.

579
00:38:35,079 --> 00:38:37,280
For a girl at Lanxiang's age,

580
00:38:37,599 --> 00:38:41,039
16 taels is more than enough
to buy her freedom.

581
00:38:42,519 --> 00:38:43,199
That's right.

582
00:38:43,559 --> 00:38:45,840
I'll find someone to ask our master

583
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:47,079
to free Lanxiang.

584
00:38:48,039 --> 00:38:48,559
Put it away.

585
00:38:48,639 --> 00:38:49,360
Put it away.

586
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:50,119
Father.

587
00:38:52,079 --> 00:38:52,880
Father.

588
00:38:53,519 --> 00:38:54,159
Mother.

589
00:38:55,159 --> 00:38:56,199
I'm very grateful

590
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,639
for your kindness.

591
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,000
But under the current law,

592
00:39:01,599 --> 00:39:02,920
I'm a hereditary slave.

593
00:39:03,064 --> 00:39:04,590
I can't be freed from servitude alone.

594
00:39:05,544 --> 00:39:07,960
What do you mean
you can't be freed from servitude alone?

595
00:39:08,400 --> 00:39:09,079
Then...

596
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:12,840
Does that mean
you'll be a servant all your life?

597
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,239
Yes.

598
00:39:14,719 --> 00:39:15,920
Mother, don't you remember?

599
00:39:16,519 --> 00:39:18,440
When Father sold himself
to the Lin family,

600
00:39:18,719 --> 00:39:20,199
he signed a life contract.

601
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:21,960
That means

602
00:39:23,079 --> 00:39:25,559
we can be freed from servitude
with Father.

603
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:28,079
With me?

604
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:29,039
Yes.

605
00:39:29,272 --> 00:39:30,710
If we're being freed from servitude,

606
00:39:30,920 --> 00:39:32,760
we do it together.

607
00:39:33,119 --> 00:39:34,599
Be freed from servitude together?

608
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:36,800
Be freed from servitude together.

609
00:39:37,199 --> 00:39:38,920
Become free citizens together.

610
00:39:40,904 --> 00:39:42,840
- Become free citizens?
- Become free citizens?

611
00:39:48,440 --> 00:39:49,159
But...

612
00:39:51,119 --> 00:39:53,440
How many years would we need
to save that much?

613
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:57,320
We won't always get lucky like this.

614
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,199
That's right.

615
00:39:58,519 --> 00:39:59,719
Father, don't you remember?

616
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:02,000
You're the third shopkeeper now.

617
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:06,960
That's true.

618
00:40:08,159 --> 00:40:09,599
You're the third shopkeeper now.

619
00:40:09,599 --> 00:40:11,239
Things are different now.

620
00:40:11,599 --> 00:40:12,920
Your monthly salary

621
00:40:12,960 --> 00:40:15,679
is much higher
than when you did odd jobs.

622
00:40:16,079 --> 00:40:18,159
And I'll get rewards for doing well.

623
00:40:18,599 --> 00:40:19,239
Lanxiang.

624
00:40:19,519 --> 00:40:21,840
Teach me more characters,

625
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:22,440
and also

626
00:40:23,079 --> 00:40:26,000
teach me how to identify
paintings and calligraphy.

627
00:40:26,392 --> 00:40:28,440
I'll work hard to make more money.

628
00:40:28,559 --> 00:40:29,039
Sure.

629
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,519
Then I...

630
00:40:31,039 --> 00:40:32,079
Starting tomorrow,

631
00:40:32,199 --> 00:40:33,840
I'll take on more embroidery work.

632
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:34,480
Lanxiang.

633
00:40:34,599 --> 00:40:36,320
These patterns you drew for me

634
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:37,199
are beautiful.

635
00:40:37,496 --> 00:40:38,590
I'll embroider them well

636
00:40:38,800 --> 00:40:40,880
and earn a few more coins.

637
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:48,559
We'll work hard together

638
00:40:49,039 --> 00:40:51,000
and buy our freedom from the Lin family.

639
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:52,960
When that day comes,

640
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:54,920
Father will open a shop.

641
00:40:55,199 --> 00:40:56,800
I'll help out at the shop.

642
00:40:57,559 --> 00:41:00,599
Mother, you can just count the money.

643
00:41:04,039 --> 00:41:04,559
Sure.

644
00:41:07,020 --> 00:41:14,020
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

645
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:20,079
Loquats! Fresh loquats!

646
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:25,360
Loquats! Fresh loquats!

647
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:29,559
Loquats!

648
00:41:29,559 --> 00:41:32,900
(Jinling Lin Residence)

649
00:41:33,800 --> 00:41:35,360
How novel!

650
00:41:36,039 --> 00:41:37,519
Red as cinnabar,

651
00:41:38,280 --> 00:41:39,920
and lovely as rouge.

652
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:42,880
I've never seen it before.

653
00:41:43,519 --> 00:41:44,880
I wonder what it's called.

654
00:41:47,159 --> 00:41:48,519
It's a new item

655
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:51,639
brought back from the West
by Defense Commander Zheng.

656
00:41:51,880 --> 00:41:54,599
It's called foreign pepper.

657
00:41:55,064 --> 00:41:56,490
- Foreign pepper?
- Foreign pepper?

658
00:41:56,719 --> 00:41:58,639
There are only a few pots

659
00:41:58,920 --> 00:42:00,280
in all of Jinling.

660
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:03,239
It looks so festive.

661
00:42:03,320 --> 00:42:04,648
Quite fitting for the occasion.

662
00:42:05,679 --> 00:42:06,840
Congratulations, Lin.

663
00:42:06,860 --> 00:42:09,100
Your son distinguished himself
fighting Japanese pirates

664
00:42:09,128 --> 00:42:10,750
and has been promoted
to Vice Commander.

665
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:12,400
He's been transferred back to Jinling.

666
00:42:12,599 --> 00:42:14,840
What a promising young man.

667
00:42:16,039 --> 00:42:17,639
He couldn't succeed in his studies,

668
00:42:17,679 --> 00:42:19,880
so he could only become a soldier.

669
00:42:20,039 --> 00:42:21,679
Lin, you're too modest.

670
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:22,800
Master.

671
00:42:23,360 --> 00:42:24,039
Master.

672
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:25,599
Master.

673
00:42:25,599 --> 00:42:26,400
(Yang Zhong, Lin Residence's)

674
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:27,608
(Head Bulter)
Young Master is back.

675
00:42:31,039 --> 00:42:32,320
That wretched boy

676
00:42:32,360 --> 00:42:34,088
had to come back right now,
of all times.

677
00:42:34,199 --> 00:42:35,920
He just had to ruin everyone's mood.

678
00:43:05,380 --> 00:43:07,660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode Preview)

679
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:12,559
Stand properly.

680
00:43:13,239 --> 00:43:15,119
Greet Young Master and Young Madam.

681
00:43:15,768 --> 00:43:17,032
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

682
00:43:17,048 --> 00:43:18,408
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

683
00:43:21,800 --> 00:43:23,239
There are 12 hereditary slaves

684
00:43:23,239 --> 00:43:24,760
who came of age this time.

685
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:27,840
First Madam chose these four

686
00:43:28,920 --> 00:43:30,440
and ordered me to bring them

687
00:43:30,920 --> 00:43:33,000
to Zhichun Hall to serve you both.

688
00:43:35,360 --> 00:43:37,360
Please tell First Madam

689
00:43:37,688 --> 00:43:38,800
we appreciate her kindness,

690
00:43:39,039 --> 00:43:40,880
but Zhichun Hall has enough staff.

691
00:43:56,701 --> 00:44:00,821
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

692
00:44:03,661 --> 00:44:08,181
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

693
00:44:09,461 --> 00:44:13,381
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

694
00:44:14,061 --> 00:44:16,821
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

695
00:44:17,541 --> 00:44:19,861
♪Though all the world may fade♪

696
00:44:19,861 --> 00:44:22,941
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

697
00:44:24,461 --> 00:44:28,701
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

698
00:44:31,621 --> 00:44:35,781
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

699
00:44:37,581 --> 00:44:41,141
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

700
00:44:41,141 --> 00:44:44,701
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

701
00:44:45,501 --> 00:44:51,181
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

702
00:44:51,541 --> 00:44:55,861
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

703
00:44:56,221 --> 00:44:59,181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

704
00:44:59,181 --> 00:45:02,941
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

705
00:45:02,941 --> 00:45:05,821
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

706
00:45:05,821 --> 00:45:09,901
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

707
00:45:09,901 --> 00:45:13,261
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

708
00:45:13,261 --> 00:45:17,021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

709
00:45:17,021 --> 00:45:21,021
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

710
00:45:21,781 --> 00:45:25,941
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

711
00:45:25,941 --> 00:45:29,381
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

712
00:45:29,381 --> 00:45:33,021
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

